  loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a>
</figure><p>民国戊辰齐白石设色《阿弥陀佛》图立轴。</p>




<figure class="figure" data-align="center">
  <a class="media-frame" href="https://huhexian.s3.bitiful.net/2023/10/05/9e66e0e5a525666fdd888dfd1150334f.webp" data-viewer>
